the knowledge base citizenshiptrust includes:

the text of the source program is at "sources/citizenshiptrust-scasp.pl".

a person acquires British citizenship on a date if
    the person is born in the_UK on the date
    and the date isafter commencement
    and a second person is a parent of the person
    and the second person is citizen or settled the date.

a person is a parent of a second person if
    the person is the mother of the second person.

a person is a parent of a second person if
    the person is the father of the second person.

a person is citizen or settled a date if
    the person is a British citizen on the date.

a person is citizen or settled a date if
    the person is settled in the UK on the date.

a person is the father of a second person if
    a third person says that the person is the father of the second person
    and the third person is qualified to determine fatherhood.

a person is the father of a second person if
    the person says that the person is the father of the second person.

